#, qt-format
msgctxt "raincloudPlots|"
msgid "This module has a %1 YouTube tutorial"
msgstr "本模块有一个 %1 YouTube 教程"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "raincloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"Note: This module has a %1 YouTube tutorial %2 & requires data in long "
"format."
msgstr "注意：本模块有一个 %1 YouTube 教程 %2，并且需要长格式数据。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"The <b>Plot Builder (beta)</b> lets you assemble a complete figure in just a "
"few clicks.<br/><br/><ol><li><b>Decide on design:</b> At the very top choose "
"<i>Repeated measurements → Yes</i> if the same subjects are measured more "
"than once (e.g., across time-points or conditions); otherwise leave <i>No</"
"i> selected. </li><li><b>Map your variables:</b> Drag variables from the "
"list on the left into the fields on the right (X-Axis, Y-Axis, etc). </"
"li><li><b>Choose what to display:</b> Expand the <i>Data and geometries</i> "
"accordion to add layers such as raw points, histograms/box-/violin plots, "
"counts, proportions, Mean or Median summaries, etc.</li><li><b>Polish the "
"figure:</b> Use the remaining accordions to fine-tune axes, titles, "
"annotations, themes, colors, sizing, and legend placement.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<b>绘图构建器（测试版）</b>让您只需点击几下即可组装出完整的图形。<br/><br/"
"><ol><li><b>确定设计：</b>如果同一批受试者被多次测量（例如跨时间点或条件），"
"请在顶部选择<i>重复测量 → 是</i>；否则保持选择<i>否</i>。</li><li><b>映射变"
"量：</b>将左侧列表中的变量拖放到右侧的字段（X 轴、Y 轴等）。</li><li><b>选择"
"显示内容：</b>展开<i>数据与几何图形</i>折叠区，添加原始数据点、直方图/箱线图/"
"小提琴图、计数、比例、均值或中位数汇总等图层。</li><li><b>润色图形：</b>使用"
"其余折叠区来微调坐标轴、标题、注释、主题、颜色、大小和图例位置。</li>"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"The basic setup: decide on the design (repeated-measures or non-repeated-"
"measures) and select the variables"
msgstr "基本设置：确定设计（重复测量或非重复测量）并选择变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select whether you want to create a repeated-measures plot or a non-repeated-"
"measures plot"
msgstr "选择要创建重复测量图还是非重复测量图"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Select this to create a non-repeated-measures plot"
msgstr "选择此项可创建非重复测量图"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Select this to create a repeated-measures plot"
msgstr "选择此项可创建重复测量图"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"ON (listwise deletion): if a case is missing even one of the selected "
"variables, the whole case is excluded.OFF: keep every case and ignore only "
"the specific values that are missing"
msgstr ""
"开启（整例删除）：如果某个个案缺少任一选定变量，则排除整个个案。关闭：保留每"
"个个案，仅忽略缺失的特定值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Delete missing values listwise"
msgstr "按整例删除缺失值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Input for non-repeated measures plot"
msgstr "非重复测量图的输入"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Select the variable for the X-Axis"
msgstr "选择 X 轴变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Select the variable for the Y-Axis"
msgstr "选择 Y 轴变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable for data grouping, which will also determine the "
"coloring."
msgstr "选择用于数据分组的变量，该变量也将决定着色。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "You can choose a variable to split the plots into columns"
msgstr "您可以选择一个变量将图拆分为列"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "You can choose a variable to split the plots into rows"
msgstr "您可以选择一个变量将图拆分为行"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "You can choose a variable to make a grid"
msgstr "您可以选择一个变量来生成网格"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Input for repeated measures plot"
msgstr "重复测量图的输入"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Here you can specify the factor for the repeated measures. For example, it "
"could be time (e.g., 24 h, 48 h, 72 h) or conditions like before and after"
msgstr ""
"在此可以指定重复测量的因子。例如，它可以是时间（如 24 h、48 h、72 h）或前后等"
"条件"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Assign the variables that correspond to each level of the repeated measures "
"factor. For example, if the factor is time, assign variables like '24h', "
"'48h', and '72h'"
msgstr ""
"为重复测量因子的每个水平指定对应的变量。例如，如果因子是时间，则指"
"定“24h”、“48h”和“72h”等变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select the between-subject factors that distinguish different groups of "
"subjects, such as treatment group, gender, or genotype. These variables must "
"be categorical (nominal) with at least two levels"
msgstr ""
"选择区分不同受试者组的组间因子，如治疗组、性别或基因型。这些变量必须是具有至"
"少两个水平的分类（名义）变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select continuous variables that may influence the outcome and should be "
"included as covariates in the analysis"
msgstr "选择可能影响结果并应作为协变量纳入分析的连续变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable for data grouping, which will also determine the coloring"
msgstr "选择用于数据分组的变量，该变量也将决定着色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Check this option to show individual data points on the plot"
msgstr "勾选此选项可在图中显示个体数据点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the point size"
msgstr "设置点大小"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Size by variable"
msgstr "按变量设置大小"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Choose this if you want the point size to be determined by a variable rather "
"than a fixed constant"
msgstr "如果希望点大小由变量决定而非固定常数，请选择此项"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Shape by variable"
msgstr "按变量设置形状"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Choose this if you want the point shape to be determined by a variable"
msgstr "如果希望点的形状由变量决定，请选择此项"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the transparency"
msgstr "设置透明度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Adjusts the horizontal “dodge” spacing between subgroup geometric elements. "
"Only takes effect when a grouping variable is mapped (e.g., male vs. female "
"within each species). A value of 0 overlays the elements; higher values push "
"the subgroups farther apart"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add a black outline/border to the elements"
msgstr "为元素添加黑色轮廓/边框"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "White outline"
msgstr "白色轮廓"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add a white outline/border to the elements"
msgstr "为元素添加白色轮廓/边框"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Remove the fill"
msgstr "移除填充"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Point Size Variable"
msgstr "点大小变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Min point size"
msgstr "最小点大小"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Max point size"
msgstr "最大点大小"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Point Shape Variable"
msgstr "点形状变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add ellipse"
msgstr "添加椭圆"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Add a statistical ellipse around the points.'Ellipse type' controls the "
"method:\"t\" assumes a multivariate t-distribution,\"Normal\" assumes a "
"multivariate normal distribution,and \"Euclidean\" draws a circle whose "
"radius equals the value of 'Level'"
msgstr ""
"在数据点周围添加统计椭圆。“椭圆类型”控制所用方法：“t”假设多元 t 分"
"布，“Normal”假设多元正态分布，“Euclidean”绘制半径等于“水平”值的圆"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Ellipse type"
msgstr "椭圆类型"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "t"
msgstr "t"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Euclidean"
msgstr "欧几里得"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Level"
msgstr "水平"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Confidence level (for t and normal ellipse type) or radius (euclidean "
"ellipse type)"
msgstr "置信水平（用于 t 和正态椭圆类型）或半径（用于欧几里得椭圆类型）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Sets the number of bins used to divide the data range in histograms.More "
"bins give finer detail, fewer bins give a more general overview"
msgstr ""
"设置直方图中用于划分数据范围的箱数。箱数越多细节越精细，箱数越少则概览越粗略"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Density"
msgstr "密度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Check this option to overlay a density estimate on the histogram. Density "
"can be shown as scaled (0–1) or on the histogram count scale."
msgstr ""
"勾选此选项可在直方图上叠加密度估计。密度可按标度（0–1）显示，也可按直方图计数"
"标度显示。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Density overlay mode"
msgstr "密度叠加模式"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Choose whether the density curve is scaled to the histogram count ('Count'), "
"or normalized to a maximum of 1 ('Scaled')"
msgstr ""
"选择密度曲线是按直方图计数标度（“计数”）缩放，还是归一化到最大值为 1（“缩"
"放”）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Show density on the histogram count scale (area under the curve equals total "
"count)"
msgstr "按直方图计数标度显示密度（曲线下面积等于总计数）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Scaled (0–1)"
msgstr "缩放（0–1）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Show density scaled so that the maximum of the curve is 1"
msgstr "显示缩放后的密度，使曲线最大值为 1"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the transparency for the density overlay"
msgstr "设置密度叠加层的透明度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the line width for the density overlay"
msgstr "设置密度叠加层的线宽"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Check this option to create boxplot. Boxplot and violin plot require both X-"
"Axis and Y-Axis variables."
msgstr "勾选此选项可创建箱线图。箱线图和小提琴图都需要 X 轴和 Y 轴变量。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Sets the line width of the geometric element (e.g., boxplot, violin, error "
"bar). Increase for thicker outlines, decrease for thinner ones"
msgstr ""
"设置几何元素（如箱线图、小提琴图、误差线）的线宽。增大可获得更粗的轮廓，减小"
"则更细"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the width of the boxplots"
msgstr "设置箱线图的宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Sets the horizontal width of the whiskers in a boxplot"
msgstr "设置箱线图中须线的水平宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Displays individual outlier points beyond the whiskers in a boxplot. "
"Outliers are defined as values that fall outside the range of Q1 − coef × "
"IQR and Q3 + coef × IQR"
msgstr ""
"显示箱线图中须线之外的各个离群点。离群值定义为超出 Q1 − 系数 × IQR 和 Q3 + 系"
"数 × IQR 范围的值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Sets the multiplier (coef) used to define outliers in a boxplot. Outliers "
"are values beyond Q1 − coef × IQR or Q3 + coef × IQR"
msgstr ""
"设置箱线图中用于定义离群值的乘数（系数）。离群值是超出 Q1 − 系数 × IQR 或 Q3 "
"+ 系数 × IQR 的值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Set the size of the outliers"
msgstr "设置离群值的大小"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Controls how the width of each violin is scaled:<b>Area</b>: all violins "
"have the same area (default in ggplot2).<b>Count</b>: violins are scaled by "
"the number of observations in each group.<b>Width</b>: all violins have the "
"same maximum width, regardless of group size."
msgstr ""
"控制每个小提琴图宽度的缩放方式：<b>面积</b>：所有小提琴图面积相同（ggplot2 默"
"认）。<b>计数</b>：按各组观测数缩放小提琴图。<b>宽度</b>：所有小提琴图的最大"
"宽度相同，与组大小无关。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Draws horizontal lines at the specified quantiles inside each violin. Use "
"comma-separated values between 0 and 1 (e.g., 0.25, 0.5, 0.75) to show "
"quartiles or other custom quantiles."
msgstr ""
"在每个小提琴图内部按指定分位数绘制水平线。使用 0 到 1 之间以逗号分隔的值（例"
"如 0.25, 0.5, 0.75）来显示四分位数或其他自定义分位数。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"If checked, the violins are trimmed to the range of the data. If unchecked, "
"the density tails may extend beyond the observed values."
msgstr ""
"若勾选，小提琴图将修剪至数据范围。若不勾选，密度尾部可能延伸到观测值之外。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"This section adds layers that visualise amounts. <b>Dodge</b> shifts "
"subgroup geoms sideways so they don’t overlap. <b>Size / Width</b> sets the "
"thickness of bars and lines or the radius of dots. <b>Transparency (alpha)</"
"b> controls opacity: 0 = invisible, 1 = solid. <b>Outline (black / white)</"
"b> toggles a border around the shape. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Enable to add dashed lines to the plot"
msgstr "启用后可在图中添加虚线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Enable to add count dots to the plot"
msgstr "启用后可在图中添加计数点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Enable to add count lines to the plot"
msgstr "启用后可在图中添加计数线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Enable to add a count area to the plot"
msgstr "启用后可在图中添加计数面积"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Enable to add count values to the plot"
msgstr "启用后可在图中添加计数值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Visualise how each subgroup contributes to the whole Requires one Group "
"variable plus either an X- or Y-axis variable Absolute mode stacks raw "
"counts; Relative mode rescales each stack to 0-1 or 0-100 % Common controls: "
"Transparency sets opacity, Reverse order flips the stack sequence, Line "
"width outlines area stacks, Replace N/A turns missing groups into a separate "
"slice"
msgstr ""
"可视化每个子组对整体的贡献。需要一个分组变量以及 X 轴或 Y 轴变量。绝对模式堆"
"叠原始计数；相对模式将每个堆叠重新缩放到 0–1 或 0–100%。常用控件：透明度设置"
"不透明度，反转顺序翻转堆叠顺序，线宽勾勒面积堆叠，替换 N/A 将缺失组变为单独的"
"分片"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Required: Group Variable AND X- or Y-Axis Variable"
msgstr "必需：分组变量以及 X 轴或 Y 轴变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Stack heights show raw counts"
msgstr "堆叠高度显示原始计数"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Each stack is rescaled so its total height equals 100 %"
msgstr "每个堆叠重新缩放，使其总高度等于 100%"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add stacked bars for each category using the selected proportion mode"
msgstr "使用选定的比例模式为每个类别添加堆叠条形"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add stacked areas connected across categories"
msgstr "添加跨类别连接堆叠面积"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Treat missing groups as a separate slice"
msgstr "将缺失组视为单独的分片"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Format the relative scale from 0 % to 100 % instead of 0 to 1"
msgstr "将相对标度格式化为 0% 到 100%，而非 0 到 1"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Summary layers that display the arithmetic mean of the Y variable for every "
"X (or vice versa). Requires both X and Y axes mapped. Mean can be rendered "
"as bar, line, dot, dash, area, or value. Common controls: <b>Dodge</b> "
"separates sub-groups, <b>Transparency</b> sets opacity, <b>Size/width</b> "
"changes thickness, <b>Outline</b> toggles borders"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add mean bars"
msgstr "添加均值条"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add dashed mean lines"
msgstr "添加均值虚线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add mean dots"
msgstr "添加均值点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add mean profile lines"
msgstr "添加均值剖面线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add filled mean areas"
msgstr "添加填充均值面积"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add numeric mean labels"
msgstr "添加数值均值标签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Sets the rounding increment for the mean value; 0.1 gives one decimal, 0.01 "
"gives two"
msgstr "设置均值数值的舍入增量；0.1 表示一位小数，0.01 表示两位"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Summary layers that display the median of the Y variable for every X (or "
"vice versa). Requires both X and Y axes mapped. Median can be rendered as "
"bar, line, dot, dash, area, or value. Common controls: <b>Dodge</b> "
"separates sub-groups, <b>Transparency</b> sets opacity, <b>Size/width</b> "
"changes thickness, <b>Outline</b> toggles borders"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add median bars"
msgstr "添加中位数条"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add dashed median lines"
msgstr "添加中位数虚线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add median dots"
msgstr "添加中位数点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add median profile lines"
msgstr "添加中位数剖面线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add filled median areas"
msgstr "添加填充中位数面积"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add numeric median labels"
msgstr "添加数值中位数标签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Sets the rounding increment for the median value; 0.1 gives one decimal, "
"0.01 gives two"
msgstr "设置中位数数值的舍入增量；0.1 表示一位小数，0.01 表示两位"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Shows variability with vertical bars or shaded ribbons. Choose <b>Range</b> "
"(min–max), <b>SD</b>, <b>SEM</b>, or <b>95 % CI</b>. Common controls: "
"<b>Dodge</b> offsets overlapping groups, <b>Width/Line width</b> adjusts "
"thickness, <b>Transparency</b> sets opacity, <b>Black lines</b> toggles "
"outlines"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add range error bars"
msgstr "添加范围误差线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add SD error bars"
msgstr "添加标准差误差线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add SEM error bars"
msgstr "添加均值标准误误差线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "95% CI error bar"
msgstr "95% 置信区间误差线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add 95 % CI error bars"
msgstr "添加 95% 置信区间误差线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add range ribbons"
msgstr "添加范围色带"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add SD ribbons"
msgstr "添加标准差色带"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add SEM ribbons"
msgstr "添加均值标准误色带"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add 95 % CI ribbons"
msgstr "添加 95% 置信区间色带"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Fit trend lines or statistical models and add reference or identity lines "
"for comparison. Curve fitting requires individual data points. Common "
"controls: <b>Method</b> chooses the model, <b>Line width</b> adjusts "
"thickness, <b>Dodge</b> separates groups, <b>Transparency</b> sets opacity, "
"and <b>Color</b> selects the line colour"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fit a model to the data points"
msgstr "对数据点拟合模型"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add reference lines"
msgstr "添加参考线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Add identity line (y = x)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Reverse direction"
msgstr "反转方向"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fine-tune the x-axis"
msgstr "微调 X 轴"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Adds a heading"
msgstr "添加标题"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Sets the range"
msgstr "设置范围"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Positions tick marks"
msgstr "定位刻度标记"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Handle rotation, shortening and sorting"
msgstr "处理旋转、缩短和排序"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Shorten axis labels using K for thousand, M for million, and so on"
msgstr "使用 K 表示千、M 表示百万等来缩短坐标轴标签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Lets you edit them manually"
msgstr "允许您手动编辑"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Fine-tune the y-axis: <b>Title</b> adds a heading, <b>Limits</b> sets the "
"range, <b>Breaks</b> positions tick marks, <b>Labels</b> handle rotation, "
"shortening and sorting, and <b>Rename labels</b> lets you edit them manually"
msgstr ""
"微调 Y 轴：<b>标题</b>添加标题，<b>范围</b>设置范围，<b>刻度</b>定位刻度标"
"记，<b>标签</b>处理旋转、缩短和排序，<b>重命名标签</b>允许您手动编辑"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Title, caption"
msgstr "标题、图注"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Use these fields to add text to your figure. <b>Title</b> appears above the "
"plot, while <b>Caption</b> appears below"
msgstr ""
"使用这些字段为图形添加文本。<b>标题</b>显示在绘图上方，<b>图注</b>显示在下方"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Annotation and data label"
msgstr "注释与数据标签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Label points automatically or place custom annotations anywhere. <b>Label "
"variable</b> shows each point’s value; <b>Custom annotations</b> add free-"
"form text with position controls. Common controls: <b>Size</b> adjusts text "
"height, <b>White background</b> improves legibility, colour fields accept "
"named or hex colours"
msgstr ""
"自动为点添加标签，或在任意位置放置自定义注释。<b>标签变量</b>显示每个点的值；"
"<b>自定义注释</b>添加带位置控制的自由文本。常用控件：<b>大小</b>调整文本高"
"度，<b>白色背景</b>提高可读性，颜色字段接受命名颜色或十六进制颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Label data by variable"
msgstr "按变量标注数据"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Label variable"
msgstr "标签变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Variable whose values will be shown next to each point"
msgstr "其值将显示在每个点旁边的变量"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "White background"
msgstr "白色背景"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Custom annotations"
msgstr "自定义注释"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Choose an overall visual style and how colours are assigned. <b>Theme</b> "
"applies a preset look, while <b>Font base size</b> scales all text. <b>Color "
"settings</b> lets you map colour to a variable, pick a palette, or enter "
"custom colours"
msgstr ""
"选择整体视觉样式以及颜色分配方式。<b>主题</b>应用预设外观，<b>字体基准大小</"
"b>缩放所有文本。<b>颜色设置</b>允许您将颜色映射到变量、选择调色板或输入自定义"
"颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Decide which variable drives colours and select a palette or provide custom "
"hex/named colours"
msgstr "决定哪个变量驱动颜色，并选择调色板或提供自定义十六进制/命名颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Choose what determines element colours"
msgstr "选择决定元素颜色的因素"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Uniform colors"
msgstr "统一颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Coloring by Group variable"
msgstr "按分组变量着色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Coloring by X variable"
msgstr "按 X 变量着色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Coloring by Y variable"
msgstr "按 Y 变量着色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Apply separate colours in different splits"
msgstr "在不同拆分中应用不同颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Here you can specify custom colors separated by commas"
msgstr "在此可以指定以逗号分隔的自定义颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "e.g. red, blue, #ff5733"
msgstr "例如 red、blue、#ff5733"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Size, margins and plot orientation"
msgstr "大小、边距与绘图方向"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Control the canvas dimensions and whitespace. <b>Plot size</b> sets the "
"pixel width × height, <b>Axis padding</b> adds proportional space inside the "
"axes, <b>Margins</b> add outer whitespace, and <b>Plot orientation</b> can "
"flip X and Y"
msgstr ""
"控制画布尺寸和空白。<b>图大小</b>设置像素宽度 × 高度，<b>坐标轴留白</b>在坐标"
"轴内添加比例空间，<b>边距</b>添加外部空白，<b>绘图方向</b>可翻转 X 和 Y"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Width and height of the exported figure in pixels"
msgstr "导出图形的宽度和高度（像素）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Axis padding"
msgstr "坐标轴留白"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fraction of the data range to leave empty inside each axis (0 – 1)"
msgstr "每个坐标轴内留空的数据范围比例（0–1）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Outer whitespace around the plot (pts)"
msgstr "绘图周围的空白（磅）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Plot orientation"
msgstr "绘图方向"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Flip swaps the X and Y axes"
msgstr "翻转会交换 X 轴和 Y 轴"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Flip plot"
msgstr "翻转图"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Control where the legend appears and what it shows. Use <b>Position</b> to "
"dock the legend or hide it. <b>Remove title</b> hides the legend heading"
msgstr ""
"控制图例出现的位置及其显示内容。使用<b>位置</b>停靠或隐藏图例。<b>移除标题</"
"b>隐藏图例标题"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Edit the text of individual legend entries"
msgstr "编辑各个图例条目的文本"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Order of geometries"
msgstr "几何元素顺序"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"point: Point<br>histogram: Histogram<br>boxplot: Boxplot<br>violin: Violin "
"plot<br>count_bar: Count bar<br>count_dash: Count dash<br>count_line: Count "
"line<br>count_area: Count area<br>count_dot: Count dot<br>count_value: Count "
"value<br>sum_bar: Sum bar<br>sum_dash: Sum dash<br>sum_line: Sum "
"line<br>sum_area: Sum area<br>sum_dot: Sum dot<br>sum_value: Sum "
"value<br>barstack: Bar stack<br>areastack: Area stack<br>mean_bar: Mean "
"bar<br>mean_dash: Mean dash<br>mean_line: Mean line<br>mean_area: Mean "
"area<br>mean_dot: Mean dot<br>mean_value: Mean value<br>median_bar: Median "
"bar<br>median_dash: Median dash<br>median_line: Median line<br>median_area: "
"Median area<br>median_dot: Median dot<br>median_value: Median "
"value<br>range_errorbar: Range error bar<br>sd_errorbar: SD error "
"bar<br>sem_errorbar: SEM error bar<br>ci95_errorbar: 95% CI error "
"bar<br>range_ribbon: Range ribbon<br>sd_ribbon: SD ribbon<br>sem_ribbon: SEM "
"ribbon<br>ci95_ribbon: 95% CI ribbon<br>curve_fit: Curve "
"fit<br>stat_ellipse: Stat ellipse<br>rm_lines: RM lines<br>reference_lines: "
"Reference lines<br>identity_line: Identity line<br>point_labels: Point labels"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"You can set the order of the added geometric/data layers here, similar to "
"the example shown in the text field.\n"
"The order of the layers is defined from left to right—meaning the rightmost "
"layer will be drawn on top."
msgstr ""
"您可以在此设置所添加几何/数据图层的顺序，类似于文本字段中显示的示例。\n"
"图层顺序由左到右定义——即最右侧的图层将绘制在最上层。"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Layer order"
msgstr "图层顺序"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "point, boxplot"
msgstr "point, boxplot"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Adjust how faceted panels share scales, axes and space. <b>Scale and axis "
"settings</b> decide whether panels use the same range, which axis lines are "
"drawn and where labels appear. <b>Layout settings</b> control panel sizes, "
"the position of the highest-value table, optional marginal plots and custom "
"axis titles"
msgstr ""
"调整分面面板共享标度、坐标轴和空间的方式。<b>标度与坐标轴设置</b>决定面板是否"
"使用相同范围、绘制哪些坐标轴线以及标签出现的位置。<b>布局设置</b>控制面板大"
"小、最高值表格的位置、可选的边际图和自定义坐标轴标题"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Choose whether facet panels share a common scale (<i>fixed</i>) or get "
"individual ranges"
msgstr "选择分面面板是共享统一标度（<i>固定</i>）还是各自使用独立范围"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Decide which facet panels display axis lines"
msgstr "决定哪些分面面板显示坐标轴线"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Control which tick-label texts are shown"
msgstr "控制显示哪些刻度标签文本"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Controls where the summary table of highest values is placed inside each "
"facet"
msgstr "控制最高值汇总表在每个分面内的放置位置"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Allow facet panels to stretch freely along X, Y or both axes"
msgstr "允许分面面板沿 X 轴、Y 轴或两个轴自由拉伸"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Adds aggregated rows/columns at the edges of the facet grid"
msgstr "在分面网格边缘添加汇总行/列"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Arrange panels when a grid variable is mapped. <b>Layout settings</b> set "
"the facet grid’s rows, columns and where the highest-values table appears, "
"<b>Scales and strip settings</b> decide whether panels share axes and where "
"the facet label strip is placed"
msgstr ""
"映射网格变量时排列面板。<b>布局设置</b>设置分面网格的行数、列数以及最高值表格"
"出现的位置，<b>标度与分面标签条设置</b>决定面板是否共享坐标轴以及分面标签条的"
"位置"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fixed number of facet columns; 0 lets the layout pick automatically"
msgstr "固定分面列数；0 表示由布局自动选择"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fixed number of facet rows; 0 lets the layout pick automatically"
msgstr "固定分面行数；0 表示由布局自动选择"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Choose the corner where the summary table of highest values is drawn"
msgstr "选择绘制最高值汇总表的角落"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Fixed panels share axes; free panels get independent X and/or Y scales"
msgstr "固定面板共享坐标轴；自由面板获得独立的 X 和/或 Y 标度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Location of the facet label strip"
msgstr "分面标签条的位置"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Add brackets with P values to show pairwise significance.\n"
"Set colour, text size and vertical spacing, then list each comparison in the "
"table below"
msgstr ""
"添加带 p 值的括号以显示成对显著性。\n"
"设置颜色、文本大小和垂直间距，然后在下方表格中列出每个比较"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Colour and font size of the P-value text"
msgstr "p 值文本的颜色和字号"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Named or hex colour for the P value text"
msgstr "p 值文本的命名颜色或十六进制颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Font size of the P value text"
msgstr "p 值文本的字号"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Starting height and step between stacked brackets (data units)"
msgstr "起始高度以及堆叠括号之间的步长（数据单位）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Initial vertical position for the first bracket"
msgstr "第一个括号的初始垂直位置"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Vertical gap between successive brackets"
msgstr "相邻括号之间的垂直间距"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Labels of the two groups being compared"
msgstr "被比较的两个组的标签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Enter the P value (e.g. 0.03) or a significance symbol (*, **, ***). <b>Tip "
"length</b> is the size of the bracket tips; <b>Bracket size</b> is the "
"horizontal width"
msgstr ""
"输入 p 值（例如 0.03）或显著性符号（*、**、***）。<b>端点长度</b>是括号端点的"
"尺寸；<b>括号大小</b>是水平宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "P value"
msgstr "p 值"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Select the facet (group/column/row/grid) where the bracket should appear"
msgstr "选择括号应出现的分面（组/列/行/网格）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Draw manual comparison lines (e.g., <b>min–max bars</b> or custom contrasts) "
"with optional text labels"
msgstr ""
"绘制手动比较线（例如<b>最小值–最大值条</b>或自定义对比），并可选择添加文本标"
"签"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Note: If custom Y-Axis limits are set, the starting\n"
"position for the Y-Axis start and end values must fall within the defined "
"interval"
msgstr ""
"注意：如果设置了自定义 Y 轴范围，Y 轴起点和终点值的起始\n"
"位置必须落在定义的区间内"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Define one comparison line with optional label, coordinates and appearance"
msgstr "定义一条比较线，可设置标签、坐标和外观"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Text shown near the line (leave empty for no label)"
msgstr "显示在线条附近的文本（留空则不显示标签）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Start/end coordinates and facet location"
msgstr "起点/终点坐标和分面位置"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Line start on X axis"
msgstr "线条在 X 轴上的起点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Line end on X axis"
msgstr "线条在 X 轴上的终点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Line start on Y axis"
msgstr "线条在 Y 轴上的起点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Line end on Y axis"
msgstr "线条在 Y 轴上的终点"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet column (for split layouts)"
msgstr "分面列（用于拆分布局）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet row (for split layouts)"
msgstr "分面行（用于拆分布局）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet grid cell"
msgstr "分面网格单元"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet column (RM)"
msgstr "分面列（重复测量）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet row (RM)"
msgstr "分面行（重复测量）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Facet grid cell (RM)"
msgstr "分面网格单元（重复测量）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Line colour and label styling"
msgstr "线条颜色和标签样式"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Named or hex colour for the line"
msgstr "线条的命名颜色或十六进制颜色"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Font size of the label text"
msgstr "标签文本的字号"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Vertical offset between the line and its label (data units)"
msgstr "线条与其标签之间的垂直偏移（数据单位）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Combine multiple plots in custom grids. <b>Arrange plots by column</b> "
"builds the top part of the layout, <b>Arrange plots by row</b> builds the "
"bottom. Specify plot IDs, relative sizes and optional common legends"
msgstr ""
"在自定义网格中组合多个图。<b>按列排列图形</b>构建布局的上部，<b>按行排列图形"
"</b>构建下部。指定图 ID、相对大小和可选的共享图例"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Comma-separated numbers that set the width of each column"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的数字，用于设置每列的宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Comma-separated IDs referencing earlier plots"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的 ID，引用先前的图"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Relative heights of plots within this column"
msgstr "此列中各图的相对高度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Optional plot labels (A, B, …)"
msgstr "可选的图标签（A、B、……）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Merge legends of all plots in this column"
msgstr "合并此列中所有图的图例"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Comma-separated numbers that set the height of each row"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的数字，用于设置每行的高度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Relative widths of plots within this row"
msgstr "此行中各图的相对宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Merge legends of all plots in this row"
msgstr "合并此行中所有图的图例"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Font size of subplot labels"
msgstr "子图标签的字号"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Horizontal offset of labels (0–1, relative to plot width)"
msgstr "标签的水平偏移（0–1，相对于图宽度）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Vertical offset of labels (0–1, relative to plot height)"
msgstr "标签的垂直偏移（0–1，相对于图高度）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid ""
"Relative heights of columns or widths of rows when combining column and row "
"layouts"
msgstr "组合列布局和行布局时各列的相对高度或各行的相对宽度"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Overall width of the assembled layout (pixels)"
msgstr "组装布局的总宽度（像素）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Overall height of the assembled layout (pixels)"
msgstr "组装布局的总高度（像素）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Gap between plots inside the layout (pixels)"
msgstr "布局内各图之间的间距（像素）"

msgctxt "jaspPlotBuilder|"
msgid "Place a single shared legend for all plots in the layout"
msgstr "为布局中的所有图放置一个共享图例"

msgctxt "raincloudPlots|"
msgid "Box statistics"
msgstr "箱线图统计量"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Plot Builder"
msgstr "绘图构建器"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Descriptives allows the user to obtain basic descriptive statistics, "
"histograms and density plots, correlation plots, boxplots, and frequency "
"tables."
msgstr ""
"描述统计允许用户获得基本描述性统计量、直方图和密度图、相关图、箱线图和频率"
"表。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "R 包"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "All variables of interest."
msgstr "所有感兴趣的变量。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Split"
msgstr "拆分"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Can be split by a categorical variable such as experimental condition."
msgstr "可按分类变量（如实验条件）拆分。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Transpose descriptives table"
msgstr "转置描述表"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Tranposes the main table"
msgstr "转置主表"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "统计量"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "样本量"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Valid"
msgstr "有效"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Number of valid observations"
msgstr "有效观测数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Missing"
msgstr "缺失"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Number of missing observations"
msgstr "缺失观测数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Quantiles"
msgstr "分位数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Percentile Values"
msgstr "百分位数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Method used to compute quantiles (see Hyndman & Fan, 1996; Langford, 2006, "
"for more information). The selection carries over to the inter-quartile "
"range (IQR) and box-plot calculations.  For ordinal variables, only types 1 "
"and 3 are supported; other types fall back to type 3.\n"
msgstr ""
"用于计算分位数的方法（更多信息参见 Hyndman & Fan, 1996；Langford, 2006）。该"
"选择也适用于四分位距（IQR）和箱线图计算。对于有序变量，仅支持类型 1 和 3；其"
"他类型回退到类型 3。\n"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "2 (SAS)"
msgstr "2（SAS）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "6 (Minitab, SPSS)"
msgstr "6（Minitab、SPSS）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "7 (R)"
msgstr "7（R）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "9"
msgstr "9"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Quartiles"
msgstr "四分位数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Displays the 25th, 50th, and 75th percentiles of the data points."
msgstr "显示数据点的第 25、50 和 75 百分位数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Cut points for: "
msgstr "切点依据： "

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Cut points for x equal groups"
msgstr "将数据分为 x 个相等组的切点"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays the cut points that divide the data into x equal groups; default is "
"4 equal groups."
msgstr "显示将数据分为 x 个相等组的切点；默认为 4 个相等组。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid " equal groups"
msgstr " 个相等组"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Percentiles:"
msgstr "百分位数："

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays the xth percentile; percentile values must be separated by a blank."
msgstr "显示第 x 百分位数；百分位数值之间必须用空格分隔。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Central tendency"
msgstr "集中趋势"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Central Tendency (only for continuous variables)"
msgstr "集中趋势（仅限连续变量）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "众数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Mode of the data points; if more than one mode exists, only the first is "
"reported. For nominal and ordinal data, the mode is the most frequent "
"observed value. For continuous data, the mode is the value with highest "
"density estimate (see 'Distribution Plots' -> 'Display density'). If a "
"footnote about multimodality for continuous variables is reported, we "
"recommend visualizing the data to check for multimodality."
msgstr ""
"数据点的众数；如果存在多个众数，仅报告第一个。对于名义和有序数据，众数是出现"
"最频繁的观测值。对于连续数据，众数是密度估计最高的值（参见“分布图”->“显示密"
"度”）。如果报告了关于连续变量多峰性的脚注，我们建议将数据可视化以检查多峰性。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Median"
msgstr "中位数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Median of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的中位数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Mean (arithmetic)"
msgstr "均值（算术平均）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Arithmetic mean of the data points; otherwise also colloquially called 'the "
"mean' or 'the average'. Calculated as the sum of all data points divided by "
"the number of data points."
msgstr ""
"数据点的算术均值；也称“均值”或“平均数”。计算为所有数据点之和除以数据点个数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Mean (geometric)"
msgstr "均值（几何平均数）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Geometric mean of the data points; defined only for strictly positive "
"variables. Calculated as the product of all data points, raised to the power "
"of 1 divided by the number of points (the n-th root of the product)."
msgstr ""
"数据点的几何平均数；仅对严格为正的变量有定义。计算为所有数据点乘积的 1/n 次幂"
"（乘积的 n 次方根）。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Mean (harmonic)"
msgstr "均值（调和平均）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Harmonic mean of the data points; defined only for strictly positive "
"variables. Calculated as the number of data points divided by the sum of the "
"reciprocals of the data points."
msgstr ""
"数据点的调和平均数；仅对严格为正的变量有定义。计算为数据点个数除以数据点倒数"
"之和。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Skewness"
msgstr "偏度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Skewness of the distribution of the data points."
msgstr "数据点分布的偏度。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Kurtosis"
msgstr "峰度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Kurtosis of the distribution of the data points."
msgstr "数据点分布的峰度。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Shapiro-Wilk test"
msgstr "Shapiro-Wilk 检验"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Sum"
msgstr "总和"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Sum of the data points."
msgstr "数据点之和。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Dispersion"
msgstr "离散程度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Dispersion (only for continuous variables)"
msgstr "离散程度（仅限连续变量）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Std. deviation"
msgstr "标准差"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Standard deviation of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的标准差。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Coefficient of variation"
msgstr "变异系数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"The Coefficient of variation gives us the relative dispersion of the data, "
"in contrast to the standard deviation, which gives the absolute dispersion. "
"For this purpose, the standard deviation is divided by the mean value, so "
"that the unit is truncated away."
msgstr ""
"变异系数给出数据的相对离散程度，而标准差给出绝对离散程度。为此，将标准差除以"
"均值，从而消去单位。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "MAD"
msgstr "MAD"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Median absolute deviation of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的中位数绝对偏差。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "MAD robust"
msgstr "MAD 稳健性"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Median absolute deviation of the data points, adjusted by a factor for "
"asymptotically normal consistency."
msgstr "数据点的中位数绝对偏差，并乘以一个因子以实现渐近正态一致性。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "IQR"
msgstr "IQR"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Interquartile range of the data points; 75th percentile - 25th percentile."
msgstr "数据点的四分位距；第 75 百分位数 - 第 25 百分位数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Variance"
msgstr "方差"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Variance of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的方差。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Range"
msgstr "范围"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Range of the data points; maximum - minimum."
msgstr "数据点的范围；最大值 - 最小值。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Minimum"
msgstr "最小值"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Minimum value of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的最小值。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "最大值"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Maximum value of the data points."
msgstr "数据点的最大值。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Inference"
msgstr "推断"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "S.E. mean"
msgstr "均值标准误"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Standard error of the arithmetic mean."
msgstr "算术平均数的标准误."

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Confidence interval for the arithmetic mean"
msgstr "算术均值的置信区间"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "置信宽度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "width of the confidence interval."
msgstr "置信区间的宽度。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"How should the confidence interval be computed? By default, we use a `T "
"model`, which yields results identical to a one-sample t-test. Alternative "
"options are a normal model (%1), or `Bootstrap`."
msgstr ""
"应如何计算置信区间？默认使用 `T 模型`，其结果与单样本 t 检验相同。其他选项包"
"括正态模型（%1）或 `Bootstrap`。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "T model"
msgstr "T 模型"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Normal model"
msgstr "正态模型"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Confidence interval for std. deviation"
msgstr "标准差的置信区间"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"a confidence interval for the standard deviation based on bootstrap samples."
msgstr "基于 bootstrap 样本的标准差置信区间。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"How should the confidence interval be computed? By default, we use an "
"analytical approach (chi-square). The alternative option is `Bootstrap`"
msgstr "应如何计算置信区间？默认使用解析方法（卡方）。其他选项为 `Bootstrap`"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Analytical (chi-square)"
msgstr "解析法（卡方）"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Confidence interval for variance"
msgstr "方差的置信区间"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "a confidence interval for the variance based on bootstrap samples."
msgstr "基于 bootstrap 样本的方差置信区间。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"How should the confidence interval be computed? By default, we use a "
"analytical approach (chi-square). The alternative option is `Bootstrap`"
msgstr "应如何计算置信区间？默认使用解析方法（卡方）。其他选项为 `Bootstrap`"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Bootstrap confidence interval options"
msgstr "Bootstrap 置信区间选项"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Bootstrap samples"
msgstr "Bootstrap 样本数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "the number of bootstrap samples to be used."
msgstr "要使用的 bootstrap 样本数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Association matrix"
msgstr "关联矩阵"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Covariance"
msgstr "协方差"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Covariance value."
msgstr "协方差值。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Correlation"
msgstr "相关"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Pearson's correlation coefficient."
msgstr "Pearson 相关系数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Use"
msgstr "使用"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "How to deal with missing values?"
msgstr "如何处理缺失值？"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "全部"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "use all observations, resulting in NA when there are missing values."
msgstr "使用所有观测值，存在缺失值时结果为 NA。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Complete observations"
msgstr "完整观测"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"missing values are handled by casewise deletion (i.e., only use rows of the "
"data set that are complete)."
msgstr "缺失值按整例删除处理（即仅使用数据集中完整的行）。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Pairwise compelete observations"
msgstr "成对完整观测"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"use all complete pairs of observations on those variables. This can result "
"in covariance or correlation matrices which are not positive semi-definite."
msgstr ""
"使用这些变量上所有完整的观测对。这可能导致协方差或相关矩阵不是半正定的。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Values are group midpoints"
msgstr "值为组中点"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Basic Plots"
msgstr "基本图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Distribution plots"
msgstr "分布图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"For continuous variables, displays a histogram and the fit of a "
"nonparametric density estimator. For nominal and ordinal variables, displays "
"a frequency distribution."
msgstr ""
"对于连续变量，显示直方图和非参数密度估计的拟合。对于名义和有序变量，显示频率"
"分布。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Correlation plots"
msgstr "相关图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays a matrix of plots between continuous variables, with scatterplots "
"between the variables in the off-diagonal entries, and histograms and "
"density plots in the diagonal entries. The line represents the fit of a 1st, "
"2nd, 3rd, or 4th order polynomial (the selection is based on the Bayesian "
"information criterion; Schwarz, 1978)."
msgstr ""
"显示连续变量之间的图矩阵，非对角线元素为变量间的散点图，对角线元素为直方图和"
"密度图。线条表示 1、2、3 或 4 阶多项式的拟合（选择基于贝叶斯信息准则；"
"Schwarz, 1978）。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Display density"
msgstr "显示密度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Display rug marks"
msgstr "显示地毯标记"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Bin width type"
msgstr "长条形宽度类型"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Sturges"
msgstr "Sturges"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Scott"
msgstr "Scott"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Doane"
msgstr "Doane"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Freedman-Diaconis"
msgstr "Freedman-Diaconis"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Number of bins"
msgstr "箱数"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Interval plots"
msgstr "区间图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays the arithmetic mean and 95%% confidence interval for the arithmetic "
"mean."
msgstr "显示算术均值及其 95%% 置信区间。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Pie charts"
msgstr "饼图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays the distribution of a variable in a pie chart where each unique "
"color an part of the pie corresponds to a unique observed value. Pie charts "
"are not shown for scale variables."
msgstr ""
"以饼图显示变量的分布，其中每种唯一颜色和饼图的一部分对应一个唯一观测值。连续"
"变量不显示饼图。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Dot plots"
msgstr "点图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays a dot plot, where the width of a dot corresponds to the bin width "
"and the height of the stacked dots represents the number of observation in "
"each bin."
msgstr "显示点图，其中点的宽度对应箱宽，堆叠点的高度表示每个箱中的观测数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Q-Q plots"
msgstr "Q-Q 图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Categorical Plots"
msgstr "分类图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Pareto plots"
msgstr "帕累托图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays the counts of each factor/level within the variable in a descending "
"order. The y-axis represents the frequency (counts as grey bars) of each "
"factor/level, the x-axis represents the factors/levels of the variable in an "
"ordered sequence."
msgstr ""
"按降序显示变量内每个因子/水平的计数。Y 轴表示每个因子/水平的频数（以灰色条形"
"表示计数），X 轴按有序序列表示变量的因子/水平。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"By default, a cumulative line is drawn indicating the proportional "
"contribution of each factor. A second vertical axis to the right side of the "
"graph scales with this cumulative line and represents percentages to enable "
"the description of the cumulative line."
msgstr ""
"默认绘制累积线，表示每个因子的比例贡献。图形右侧的第二个垂直轴与该累积线对应"
"缩放，表示百分比，以便描述累积线。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"If \"Pareto rule\" is enabled, the two new lines enable a more precise "
"assessment of factor/level contribution to the overall contribution (in "
"percent) by using different input numbers."
msgstr ""
"如果启用“帕累托规则”，这两条新线可通过输入不同的数值，更精确地评估因子/水平对"
"总体贡献（百分比）的贡献。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Pareto rule"
msgstr "帕累托规则"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Shift accumulation line"
msgstr "移动累积线"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Shifts the cumulative line so that it starts at the top-right corner of the "
"first bar instead of in the middle. This corresponds to the traditional "
"Pareto chart layout."
msgstr ""
"移动累积线，使其从第一个条形的右上角而非中间开始。这对应于传统的帕累托图布"
"局。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Tilt x-axis labels"
msgstr "倾斜 X 轴标签"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Tilts the x-axis labels by 45 degrees to improve readability when there are "
"many long levels."
msgstr "将 X 轴标签倾斜 45 度，以便在存在许多长水平时提高可读性。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Add count variable"
msgstr "添加计数变量"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify an additional variable that contains the counts for "
"each category instead of letting the analysis compute frequencies "
"automatically. This is useful when the data are already aggregated (e.g., "
"each row represents a category with an associated frequency). If left empty, "
"counts are calculated directly from the selected variable."
msgstr ""
"允许您指定一个包含每个类别计数的附加变量，而不是让分析自动计算频数。当数据已"
"经聚合时（例如每行代表一个类别及其关联频数），这很有用。如果留空，则直接从所"
"选变量计算计数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Likert plots"
msgstr "Likert 图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Displays a horizontally stacked bar chart showing the contribution of levels "
"within a variable in percent. Order of levels depends on defined order in "
"the JASP data table. A legend below the graph provides an overview of levels "
"and their respective colors in the graph."
msgstr ""
"显示水平堆叠条形图，以百分比表示变量内各水平的贡献。水平的顺序取决于 JASP 数"
"据表中定义的顺序。图下方的图例概述了各水平及其在图中对应的颜色。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"The y-axis represents the variables used, the x-axis represents the "
"percentages. Percentage contribution of all lower-order (below the middle "
"level) and higher-order (above the middle level) levels are displayed on "
"their respective side of the graph."
msgstr ""
"Y 轴表示所使用的变量，X 轴表示百分比。所有低阶（低于中间水平）和高阶（高于中"
"间水平）水平的百分比贡献分别显示在图的相应一侧。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"The graph displays percentages on the x-axis as positive in both directions. "
"Reason for the chosen display (in two directions) is the graphs usefulness "
"in survey research where levels often follow a Likert based order (e.g., "
"high - low, likely - unlikely, agreement - disagreement). Therefore, the "
"graph contains a split between levels at their median."
msgstr ""
"该图在 X 轴上将两个方向的百分比均显示为正值。选择这种显示方式（双向）的原因在"
"于该图在调查研究中的实用性，因为各水平通常遵循基于 Likert 的顺序（例如高-低、"
"可能-不可能、同意-不同意）。因此，该图在水平的中位数处进行拆分。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"The number of variable levels determines the number of layers displayed. "
"Layers represent the percentage distribution of the levels of the variable "
"under investigation."
msgstr "变量水平的数量决定显示的层数。各层表示所研究变量各水平的百分比分布。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"If the variables contain an uneven amount of levels, the middle level is "
"displayed as a grey block in the middle of the stacked bar with its "
"percentage contribution on top."
msgstr ""
"如果变量的水平数为奇数，则中间水平显示为堆叠条形中间的灰色块，其百分比贡献显"
"示在顶部。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Assume all variables share the same levels"
msgstr "假设所有变量共享相同的水平"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Adjustable font size for vertical axis"
msgstr "可调整垂直轴的字号"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Large"
msgstr "大"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Customizable Plots"
msgstr "可自定义图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Boxplots"
msgstr "箱线图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"For continuous variables, displays a boxplot. Optionally, the outliers are "
"labelled. Outliers are based on the interquartile range (IQR), i.e., [25th "
"percentile] - 1.5 × IQR and [75th percentile] + 1.5 × IQR. Can also display "
"in color, and has selectable boxplot, violin, and jitter elements for "
"displaying the distribution of the data. This can be split by a categorical "
"variable such as experimental condition."
msgstr ""
"对于连续变量，显示箱线图。可选择标记离群值。离群值基于四分位距（IQR），即 "
"[第 25 百分位数] - 1.5 × IQR 和 [第 75 百分位数] + 1.5 × IQR。也可以彩色显"
"示，并提供可选的箱线图、小提琴图和抖动元素来显示数据分布。可按分类变量（如实"
"验条件）拆分。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Boxplot element"
msgstr "箱线图元素"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Violin element"
msgstr "小提琴图元素"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Jitter element"
msgstr "抖动元素"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Use color palette"
msgstr "使用调色板"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Label outliers"
msgstr "标记离群值"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Scatter plots"
msgstr "散点图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Graph above scatter plot"
msgstr "散点图上方的图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Density"
msgstr "密度"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Histogram"
msgstr "直方图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Graph right of scatter plot"
msgstr "散点图右侧的图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Add regression line"
msgstr "添加回归线"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "线性"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "平滑"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Show confidence interval"
msgstr "显示置信区间"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Show legend"
msgstr "显示图例"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Frequency plots"
msgstr "频率图"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"visualizes data distributions, adapting to the type of variable selected. "
"For scale variables, it generates histograms or density plots to show "
"continuous data distributions. For categorical variables, it creates bar "
"plots displaying counts or proportions of each category."
msgstr ""
"可视化数据分布，并根据所选变量类型进行调整。对于连续变量，生成直方图或密度图"
"以显示连续数据分布。对于分类变量，创建条形图显示每个类别的计数或比例。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Separate frequencies:"
msgstr "分离频率："

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Type for scale variables:"
msgstr "连续变量的类型："

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Whether to display a density plot or histogram."
msgstr "显示密度图还是直方图。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "How to combine separate frequencies"
msgstr "如何组合分离频率"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Options for separate bins of the histogram"
msgstr "直方图分离箱的选项"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Stack"
msgstr "堆叠"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Stack: Bars are stacked vertically, combining counts across categories "
"within each bin."
msgstr "堆叠：条形垂直堆叠，合并每个箱内各类别的计数。"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "恒等"

msgctxt "Descriptives|"
msgid ""
"Identity: Bars are layered on top of each other, with transparency often "
"used to distinguish overlapping data."
msgstr "恒等：条形彼此层叠，通常使用透明度来区分重叠的数据。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Descriptives|"
